             {%+ if something %}yay{% endif %}
     </div>
 
+Similarly, you can manually disable the ``trim_blocks`` behavior by
+putting a plus sign (``+``) at the end of a block::
+
+    <div>
+        {% if something +%}
+            yay
+        {% endif %}
+    </div>
+
 You can also strip whitespace in templates by hand.  If you add a minus
